# Heizou Yelan Ororon Fischl. ~18s Rot. Heizou Taser in ST w/ P-Amber Heizou bursting once per rotation. 3EM >= ADC in ST. 1E Yelan. Fischl alternates skill and burst.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
